---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, '/');
---
<BaseLayout locale="en" active="about" title="About" description="Tiago Santos: professional experience in marketing, design and operations, with technical skills demonstrated through five functional personal projects.">
  <section class="container page-heading editorial-heading"><p class="eyebrow">About</p><h1>From communication and operations to application development.</h1><p class="page-intro">My professional background combines digital marketing, graphic design, operations, customer service and website management. Through personal projects, I apply that experience to building digital tools.</p></section>
  <section class="container editorial-section" aria-label="Professional profile">
    <article class="profile-card profile-card-primary"><span class="project-index">01 / PROFESSIONAL BACKGROUND</span><h2>Communication and operations</h2><p>Professional experience in digital marketing, graphic design for advertising, business operations, customer service and website management. This background informs how I approach information, usability and operational needs.</p><div class="tag-list"><span class="tag">Digital marketing</span><span class="tag">Graphic design</span><span class="tag">Operations</span><span class="tag">Customer service</span><span class="tag">Website management</span></div></article>
    <article class="profile-card profile-card-learning"><span class="project-index">02 / PERSONAL PROJECTS</span><h2>Skills demonstrated through working applications</h2><p>Smart Clinic Assistant, Forma &amp; Grão, PRISMA, Pauta and MyJobs have public demos, source code and case studies. They demonstrate HTML, CSS, JavaScript, TypeScript, testing and web deployment across interfaces, data handling and digital workflows.</p><p>These are personal projects using fictional scenarios, not client work or commercial results. AI-assisted development does not imply AI integration in the applications: Pauta uses deterministic templates, without generative AI.</p><a class="text-link" href={base + 'en/projects/'}>View projects and case studies <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
    <article class="profile-card profile-card-note"><span class="project-index">03 / CAREER INTERESTS</span><h2>Areas of interest and further development</h2><p>My career interests are AI Automation &amp; Digital Operations, Web Development and AI-assisted Software Development. AI integration and business automation are areas for further development; these projects do not represent commercial AI experience or enterprise automations in production.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href={base + 'cv/Tiago_Santos_CV_EN.pdf'} download>Download CV</a><a class="text-link" href={base + 'en/contact/'}>Get in touch <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
